,"What activity do you do after school?","Do you have any hobbies?","Yes, I have several hobbies.","How long have you had these hobbies?","I have had them for several years.","Because they help me relax and have fun.","Do your hobbies help you learn new things?","Yes, they help me develop new skills.","Which hobby is most expensive?","Photography is the most expensive hobby.","Do you spend a lot of money on your hobbies?","Not too much, but some equipment can be costly.","Where do you practice your hobbies?","I practice at home or with friends.","Do you do your hobbies every day?","Not every day, but several times a week.","I would like to learn to play the guitar.","Is learning a new hobby difficult?","Chemistry is more difficult than biology.","It takes time and practice, but it is rewarding.","Can I turn my hobby into a career?","Yes, many people do that.","What is the best hobby for children?","It depends on what the child enjoys.","Where is the post office from here?","The post office is down the street on the right.","How far is it?","It is about five minutes away.","Can I walk there?","Yes, it is within walking distance.","Is it near the park?","Yes, it is very close to the park.","Go straight until you see the red building.","It is on the left side of the street.","There is a small shop next to it.","No, keep going straight for another block.","You should turn at the yellow house.","Is it easy to find?","Yes, it is very noticeable.","This classroom is smaller than that one.","Which class is more difficult?","Is your backpack heavier or lighter than mine?","My sister is younger than me.","My brother is older than my sister.","This restaurant is better than that one.","The service is faster here.","The food is more delicious too.","Which sport is more popular?","Soccer is more popular than basketball.","Which sport is easier to learn?","Swimming is more difficult than running.","I think swimming is better for your body.","Is this movie more entertaining?","This movie is longer than that one.","Yes, I think the story is more interesting.","The main character is more likable.","The villain is scarier.","This game is more fun than the other one.","Which game is more challenging?","This fruit is sweeter than that one.","Which apple tastes better?","This juice is fresher than the other one.","Is fresh juice healthier?"]}
